4. The interface prototype (demo/)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

demo/index.html is the design document for the two applications, kept runnable in
a browser as a copy of 素材/ui-prototype/cubsync-ui-demo.html from the project
workspace. It is a design artefact, not a build of the product: it simulates the
interface and performs no file transfer.

Its screen text is Chinese, deliberately. Localisation of the applications is not
started; the prototype is not a localisation target.

